PUSH17 1
ADD
SWAP2
SWAP1
SMOD
SWAP1

DUP1
CALLDATALOAD
PUSH0
BYTE
PUSH1 5
SHL
JUMP

// ADDMOD 0x08
JUMPDEST
PUSH17 1
ADD
SWAP3
SWAP2
ADDMOD
SWAP1

DUP1
CALLDATALOAD
PUSH0
BYTE
PUSH1 5
SHL
JUMP

// MULLMOD 0x09
JUMPDEST
PUSH17 1
ADD
SWAP3
SWAP2
MULMOD
SWAP1

DUP1
