SWAP3                                     // Stack: [offset, address, destOffset, size, j]
SWAP2                                     // Stack: [destOffset, address, offset, size, j]
SWAP1                                     // Stack: [address, destOffset, offset, size, j]
EXTCODECOPY

DUP1
CALLDATALOAD
PUSH0
BYTE
PUSH1 5
SHL
JUMP

